### star-plan-decomposer/SKILL.md
--- 1
Check the root's `finalized:`, the one signal that a top-level plan is ready to consume (`star-plan-coach` sets it only when all six sections are `done`/`skipped` and the rubric was run and answered, and clears it whenever a section reopens). Not finalized → read its `status` map and body, name which sections are `pending`/`in_progress` or `[TBD]`-ridden (especially **method** and **milestones**), tell the user decomposition will be shallow, and offer via `star_questionnaire`: *decompose anyway (gaps become `[TBD]` in sub-plans)* / *go back to `star-plan-coach` to finish the parent first* (recommended). Respect the choice.
